# After `git pull` (or any merge): rebuild Storybook's Changelog page data from the new git log.
# .ai/maps/changelog.json is git-ignored, so pulling never updates it by itself — without this the page
# kept showing the history as of the last local commit or `pnpm install`. Only rewrites the file; a running
# Storybook picks it up through hot reload.
pnpm -s docs:changelog
